      "message": "Yeah, I think I\u0027m going to rework this as just a config fix with no behavioral difference. Sites that set `httpd.acceptorThreads` will see a difference though, but I think that\u0027s the cleaner fix for now. Then I\u0027ll follow up with more improvements that hopefully will let admins use defaults.",
