      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that selectors are separately configurable, this sizing guidance should mention them, something like:\n\nJetty leases executor threads for both acceptors and selectors via ThreadPoolBudget,\nso raising httpd.selectorThreads (or acceptorThreads) may require raising\nhttpd.maxThreads too.",
